34
00:01:29,350 --> 00:01:32,060
It was an incredible
prediction or insight,

35
00:01:32,060 --> 00:01:35,300
because we've made a lot
of progress since Galileo.

36
00:01:35,300 --> 00:01:38,200
And indeed now, just a few
equations on a single page

37
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:43,270
can describe how the universe
works extremely precisely.

38
00:01:43,270 --> 00:01:47,020
Also in a famous essay called
"The Unreasonable Effectiveness

39
00:01:47,020 --> 00:01:49,000
