47
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:16,100
And if you look around us
in the world we live in,

48
00:02:16,100 --> 00:02:18,430
the civilization, the
culture, all the tech,

49
00:02:18,430 --> 00:02:20,440
that makes our current world--

50
00:02:20,440 --> 00:02:24,730
well, basically mathematics is
just at the core of everything.

51
00:02:24,730 --> 00:02:28,870
And maybe I would also like
to argue that mathematics

52
00:02:28,870 --> 00:02:31,010
